      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 Éditions françaises de radiologie. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Acute thrombosis of the celiac trunk is a very uncommon condition, which is a life-threatening emergency. The clinical presentation is highly variable depending on the extent of the ischemic territory. We report a case of biliary peritonitis related to an acute thrombosis of the celiac trunk. This case highlights the role of abdominal computed tomography in the diagnosis of acute upper abdominal pain."
      },
